  "rt-features-integration-html": "\n              <li>Increase customer loyalty by 30% compared with traditional loyalty programs based on cards or registrations (email or phone number).</li>\n              <li>Multiply by 5 the number of customer reviews on platforms like Google or TripAdvisor</li>\n              <li>Easily propose your current offers</li>\n              <li>Allow your customers to collect loyalty points </li>\n              <li>Increase the reach of your communications by a factor of 4 compared with email tickets</li>\n            ",
